      ":question/problem": "Given that we are considering only Boolean functions with $3$ variables $a$, $b$, and $c$, which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $a^(\u2015)\u2228b$ is a literal\n2. $a\u2227b^(\u2015)\u2227c$ is a minterm\n3. $(a\u2227b)\u2228(a^(\u2015)\u2227c)$ is a disjunctive normal form\n4. $(a\u2227b\u2227c)\u2228(a^(\u2015)\u2227b\u2227c^(\u2015))$ is a principal disjunctive normal form"
